# Declares the collaboration Worker's local secret surface. NOT a secret file: the value below is an
# obvious placeholder, and only the NAME matters.
#
# `wrangler types` reads this file explicitly (see package.json) so the generated
# `worker-configuration.d.ts` is reproducible without a developer's untracked `.dev.vars`.
#
# COLLABORATION_TICKET_SECRET must hold the same value as Core's COLLABORATION_TICKET_SECRET in the
# same environment: Core signs collaboration tickets with it and this Worker verifies them. Without a
# value of at least 32 characters the Worker refuses every canvas request. Real values live in your
# own untracked `apps/collaboration/.dev.vars`, and in Cloudflare via `wrangler secret put`.

# Deliberately shorter than the 32-character minimum: a copied example fails closed until a real
# value is set.
COLLABORATION_TICKET_SECRET=invalid-placeholder
